+
+/* The watcher's wake ignores suppress_notify. The EQ may be inside the
+ * re-check drain that follows its hand-off; a wake held back there is lost
+ * when that drain returns empty, since the EQ then sleeps neither watched
+ * nor armed. A spare wake costs one empty poll. */
